[R — THE R11 CEILING GATE, RE-DERIVED ON THE IDENTITY CONTROL]
      🔴 fb422. fb421 measured R11 on `Width`, and `Width` is an EQUAL-POWER M/S
      ROTATION: at 1.0 theta = pi/2, so mid is multiplied by cos(pi/2) = 0 BY
      CONSTRUCTION. corr = -1.000 and a -130 dB mono fold are the arithmetic
      consequence of zeroing mid on ANY stereo signal — they cannot read anything
      else. A skeptic replaced the ENTIRE widening machine with a fixed 12 ms Haas
      delay and all six of those gates stayed green WITH BETTER NUMBERS, identical
      to three decimals on all six Types.
      R11 is now measured on the IDENTITY control — `Amount` at 100 % on every
      Type, and `Feedback`+`Voices` at 100 % together — with WIDTH PINNED AT 0.5,
      which is EXACTLY unity, so the rotation contributes nothing at all.

